{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spaceborn: Awakening is a <i>narrative-driven roguelike survivor</i> where you play as the legendary crew of the Nomad, each with unique abilities, playstyles, and destinies. Responding to a mysterious distress signal from an outer system space station where the crew stumbles across cosmic forces \u2014the awakening has come.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/5b08e7d58169ffe856362526b7145eb1.poster.avif?t=1760372948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/5b08e7d58169ffe856362526b7145eb1.webm?t=1760372948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/5b08e7d58169ffe856362526b7145eb1.mp4?t=1760372948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through waves of enemies, uncover forbidden experiments, and face the corrupted as the station shifts around you. Scavenge powerful weapons, harness your emerging Spaceborn abilities, and survive for as long as you can. How deep will you venture before the void consumes you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AWAKEN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/ec8d0c3db753f6697c6cb64e0579d171.poster.avif?t=1760372948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/ec8d0c3db753f6697c6cb64e0579d171.webm?t=1760372948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/ec8d0c3db753f6697c6cb64e0579d171.mp4?t=1760372948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and absorb energy to level up, unlocking powerful new abilities and weapon upgrades. Each run offers randomized upgrades and evolutions, forcing you to adapt your strategy and grow stronger with every encounter. No two awakenings are the same \u2014 and every choice brings you closer to becoming something more than human.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DESTROY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/3bbad5d4d064772686fcf33aa54b9337.poster.avif?t=1760372948\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/3bbad5d4d064772686fcf33aa54b9337.webm?t=1760372948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/extras/3bbad5d4d064772686fcf33aa54b9337.mp4?t=1760372948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3049240?t=1760372948","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/b227f4fddf64aecfe8d5d082c8a3d34d129563f0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760372948","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/96a7cc4b5135bb15def1ec2505cf463b3561fd69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760372948","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049240/96a7cc4b5135bb15def1ec2505cf463b3561fd69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760372948","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detail